        "text": "According to Court, petitioner Michael Nance sued under 42 U.S.C. \u00a7\u202f1983 to stop Georgia from using lethal injection to carry out his execution, alleging that the method poses a substantial risk of severe pain."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "92b7e67d77f48b236327c2f0a5c6b06d57ba27da70d4277e2f399275ecf9684c",
